---
title: Pi Live Terminal
description: Pi extension with a live tmux widget and long-running terminal tools.
github: https://github.com/tanishqkancharla/pi-live-terminal
last_edited: June 18, 2026
status: published
tags: [typescript]
---

Adds `live_terminal_run` / `live_terminal_close` and a tmux widget inside Pi, so long-running or interactive commands stay visible.
